	(text "BIG MODULAR 16BIT - S1 schematic (Bread Modular 16bit for Eurorack, 6HP, 4 layers). Circuit intent: docs/research.md; placement: docs/geometry.json"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0246fd9d-e345-5b0b-8c2a-5dfe9e64a9d2")
	)
	(text "DAC + OUTPUTS: PT8211 (I2S GPIO1-3) -> 1k/10n -> U5A/U5B gain 6.1 with -5.1 x VOFF (1.98 V):\nfull scale 1.65 V +/- 0.825 V -> 0 V +/- 5.0 V, DC coupled, 1k series to J4 (L) / J5 (R)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 424.18 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "58b99e02-f094-5ab3-b2be-283253400628")
	)
	(text "MIDI IN (TS): MIDI V2 / 8bit NPN front end at 3.3 V, no opto"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "71f4baaa-34dc-5e49-b8d2-90ad954a8531")
	)
	(text "POWER: +12V -> D2 -> +12V_F (U5 V+, U8 AMS1117-5.0 -> +5V -> U9 AMS1117-3.3 -> +3V3); -12V -> D3 -> -12V_F (U5 V-)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7f604059-caee-5f63-a7f5-b6d103243337")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG: GND/+12V/-12V mark the Eurorack entry at J6; +12V_F/-12V_F are fed only through D2/D3;\n+1V1 (core regulator via L1) and VREG_AVDD (via R4) are fed through passive parts."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b250e321-583c-5df6-854d-16a91e3cfe10")
	)
	(text "MODE: SW1 (6 x 6 mm THT tact) on GPIO12, red LED on GPIO13 through 1k (Bread Modular pins).\nGPIO13 is PWM6B: the duty cycle sets the LED brightness."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 322.58 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "bd311a8f-23b6-5580-861d-eebe5805565b")
	)
	(text "CV IN 1/2: tip normalled to +5V -> RV1/RV2 50k attenuator -> U7 TL072 follower\n-> 100k / 56k to +3V3 / 120k to GND, BAT54SW clamp, 1n -> U6 MCP6002 follower -> ADC0/ADC1.\nUnpatched: RV = 0..+5 V knob. Patched: RV scales the CV. -5.9..+6.0 V -> 0..3.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 203.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e907259a-e7cb-508b-8dc5-e13fd96ce28e")
	)
	(text "KNOBS 3/4: 50k dividers on +3V3 -> ADC2 (GPIO28) / ADC3 (GPIO29),\nthe Bread Modular knob channels."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 220.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f925dc1d-42a9-590a-a2ae-f0d90ac09217")
	)
	(text "JP1 RX SOURCE (back, shipped OPEN, bridge one pair): 1-2 = PROTECTED (Q1 drives GPIO5,\nfirmware inverts the input); 2-3 = DIRECT (unprotected, stock BM 16bit firmware). Never both."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "fdaaf4ee-cb32-53af-bfd4-bcd6d82f8d24")
	)
